<title>UK: London&amp;Manchester profits up 10.8 pct.</title>
<headline>London&amp;Manchester profits up 10.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		37.85		  vs 36.60</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 13.69		  vs 12.62</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 20.29		  vs 18.90</p>
<p> Distributable profit   39.5		   vs 35.7</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    46.6		   vs 56.8</p>
<p> Operating profit	 53.25		  vs 49.73</p>
<p>NOTE - Adjusted distributable profits 28.9 million stg versus 26.7 million, equivalent to earnings per share 23.65p against 21.98p.</p>
<p>Full company name of insurance company - London &amp; Manchester Group Plc.</p>
